# Conformance probe pack for ruling 1 of spec 0.18 with ruling 23 of 0.9 on
# the `json` wire. Public. No kinds. Two lines name the member `s`: the
# first, s2 with y, and the third, callsign; the line of x lies between
# them. A suppressed line still names its locator, so when y is not held the
# value of callsign is written at the position of the first line, before x.
# y is mapped by no line of this pack.
format  conformance-cond-place-json
version 0.18.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses    probe
wire    json
field   probe.s2  s  string  with probe.y
field   probe.x   x  int
field   callsign  s  string
